.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]status\f[R]: Check VM status
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]open\f[R]: Open the control panel in browser
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]logs\f[R]: View VM logs
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]shell\f[R]: Open a shell in the VM container
